[statement]
Reduced from postmarketOS v26.06 over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and
`community`, 2026-11-11), asked for `plasma-mobile-meta`; the records it
keeps are all Alpine's. `webkit2gtk-6.0`, reached through `bluedevil`,
`obexd` and `evolution-data-server`, needs
`dbus:org.freedesktop.Secrets`, which `kwallet` and `oo7-server`, of no
priority, provide at no version; `plasma-workspace` needs `kwallet`
through `so:libKF6Wallet.so.6`. apk installs `kwallet` alone, where
ferrata adds `oo7-server`. Observed; the secrets family.

